# Version bump

Every time you change player source, resources, or build scripts, bump the version in `src/appinfo.h` (`APP_VER_*`, `APP_VERSION_A`) before finishing.

- Patch (`x.y.Z`): bugfixes, polish, tiny UI tweaks
- Minor (`x.Y.0`): new features or user-visible behavior
- Major (`X.0.0`): breaking changes or major redesign

Do not leave a changed build with the same version string as the previous one.
